Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Staging|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|pageVersioningEnabled|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Enable And Delete Site Page Variation Page
Priority: 4
	Given Staging add Site Pages Variation PG
		|copySitePagesVariationName|Main Variation|
		|sitePagesVariationName|Test Site Pages Variation|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|pageStaging|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging mark As Ready For Publication
	And Staging change Site Page Variation PG
		|sitePagesVariationMenulistName|Main Variation|
		|sitePagesVariationName|Test Site Pages Variation|
	And Staging enable Page In Site Pages Variation
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|sitePagesVariationName|main-variation|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Page delete PG
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
Scenario: Publish Custom Portlet Title
Priority: 3
	Given Staging add Site Pages Variation PG
		|sitePagesVariationName|Site Pages Variation Name|
	When Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging view Site Pages Variation PG
		|sitePagesVariationName|Site Pages Variation Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Sites Directory|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Sites Directory|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Look and Feel Configuration|
	And IFrame select Configuration Frame
	And Portlet configure Custom Title Via Lookandfeel PG
		|portletName|Sites Directory|
	And Portlet configure Application Decorator Via Lookandfeel PG
		|applicationDecorator|Decorate|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Sites Directory Custom|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging configure Publish To Live
		|applicationName|Sites Directory|
		|markAsReadyForPublication|true|
	And Staging publish To Live
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view No Specific PG
		|portletName|Sites Directory|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging publish To Live
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Sites Directory Custom|
Scenario: Staging Blogs CP
Priority: 3
	Given ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
		|siteScopeName|Site Name|
	When Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	Then Staging publish To Live
Scenario: Staging Logo
Priority: 3
	Given Page view Default Logo PG
	When Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Public Pages
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And Page change Logo Via Page CP
		|logoFile|Document_2.png|
		|page|Public Pages|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page view Custom Logo PG
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging configure Publish To Live
		|uncheckLogo|true|
	And Staging publish To Live
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Page view Default Logo PG
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging publish To Live
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Page view Custom Logo PG
Scenario: Staging Portlet Publish Content Count
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	When WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And Staging view Publish Content Count Via Portlet Staging CP
		|contentCount|1|
		|contentInformation|Web Content (1)|
		|stagingDateRange|From Last Publish Date|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And Staging publish To Live Now Via Portlet CP
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	Then Staging view No Publish Content Count Via Portlet Staging CP
		|stagingDateRange|From Last Publish Date|
Scenario: Staging Site Variation Incomplete Page
Priority: 4
	Given Staging add Site Pages Variation PG
		|sitePagesVariationName|Site Pages Variation Name|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|pageStaging|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Pages
		|page|Public Pages|
		|site|Site Name|
	And Page select Site Pages Variation Name
		|sitePagesVariationName|Main Variation|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Test Page Name|
	Then Staging view Incomplete Page Via Staging Page Variation
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|sitePagesVariationName|main-variation|
Scenario: Staging Version History
Priority: 4
	Given Click at locator 'Icon#STAGING_BAR_VERTICAL_ELLIPSIS'
	When Click at locator 'Staging#HISTORY_BUTTON'
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#METADATA_SETS_IFRAME'
	And these variables
		|historyVersion||
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging view History Version PG
		|historyVersion|${historyVersion}|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Staging view History Version PG
		|historyVersion|${historyVersion}|
		|modifiedVersion|true|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging undo Staging Page Versioning PG
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view No Specific PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Staging view History Version PG
		|historyVersion|${historyVersion}|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging redo Staging Page Versioning PG
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Staging view History Version PG
		|historyVersion|${historyVersion}|
		|modifiedVersion|true|
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	Then Staging publish To Live